  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Register request/session scopes, a <a href=\"ServletContextAwareProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context.support\"><code>ServletContextAwareProcessor</code></a>, etc.",
      "translation": "注册请求/会话范围，<a href=\"ServletContextAwareProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context.support\"><code>ServletContextAwareProcessor</code></a> 等。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<b>This is the web context to be subclassed for a different bean definition format.</b>\nSuch a context implementation can be specified as \"contextClass\" context-param\nfor <a href=\"../ContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>ContextLoader</code></a> or as \"contextClass\"\ninit-param for <a href=\"../../servlet/FrameworkServlet.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>FrameworkServlet</code></a>,\nreplacing the default <a href=\"XmlWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context.support\"><code>XmlWebApplicationContext</code></a>. It will then automatically\nreceive the \"contextConfigLocation\" context-param or init-param, respectively.",
      "translation": "<b>这是用于不同 bean 定义格式的 Web 上下文子类。</b>\n此类上下文实现可指定为 <a href=\"../ContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>ContextLoader</code></a> 的 \"contextClass\" context-param，或作为 <a href=\"../../servlet/FrameworkServlet.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>FrameworkServlet</code></a> 的 \"contextClass\" init-param，以替换默认的 <a href=\"XmlWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context.support\"><code>XmlWebApplicationContext</code></a>。随后它将自动接收相应的 \"contextConfigLocation\" context-param 或 init-param。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This class is as easy to subclass as AbstractRefreshableApplicationContext:\nAll you need to implement is the <a href=\"../../../context/support/AbstractRefreshableApplicationContext.html#loadBeanDefinitions(org.springframework.beans.factory.support.DefaultListableBeanFactory)\"><code>AbstractRefreshableApplicationContext.loadBeanDefinitions(DefaultListableBeanFactory)</code></a> method;\nsee the superclass javadoc for details. Note that implementations are supposed\nto load bean definitions from the files specified by the locations returned\nby the <a href=\"#getConfigLocations()\"><code>getConfigLocations()</code></a> method.",
      "translation": "该类继承自 `AbstractRefreshableApplicationContext` 同样简单：\n您只需实现 `<a href=\"../../../context/support/AbstractRefreshableApplicationContext.html#loadBeanDefinitions(org.springframework.beans.factory.support.DefaultListableBeanFactory)\"><code>AbstractRefreshableApplicationContext.loadBeanDefinitions(DefaultListableBeanFactory)</code></a>` 方法；有关详细信息，请参阅父类的 Javadoc。请注意，实现类应从由 `<a href=\"#getConfigLocations()\"><code>getConfigLocations()</code></a>` 方法返回的位置指定的文件中加载 Bean 定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that WebApplicationContext implementations are generally supposed\nto configure themselves based on the configuration received through the\n<a href=\"../ConfigurableWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>ConfigurableWebApplicationContext</code></a> interface. In contrast, a standalone\napplication context might allow for configuration in custom startup code\n(for example, <a href=\"../../../context/support/GenericApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.context.support\"><code>GenericApplicationContext</code></a>).",
      "translation": "请注意，WebApplicationContext 实现通常应根据通过<a href=\"../ConfigurableWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>ConfigurableWebApplicationContext</code></a>接口接收到的配置来自行配置。相比之下，独立的应用上下文可能允许在自定义启动代码中进行配置（例如，<a href=\"../../../context/support/GenericApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.context.support\"><code>GenericApplicationContext</code></a>）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Interprets resource paths as servlet context resources, i.e. as paths beneath\nthe web application root. Absolute paths, for example, for files outside the web app root,\ncan be accessed via \"file:\" URLs, as implemented by\n<a href=\"../../../core/io/DefaultResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>DefaultResourceLoader</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将资源路径解释为 Servlet 上下文资源，即 Web 应用程序根目录下的路径。对于 Web 应用程序根目录之外的文件等绝对路径，可以通过由<a href=\"../../../core/io/DefaultResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>DefaultResourceLoader</code></a>实现的\"file:\" URL 进行访问。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Replace <code>Servlet</code>-related property sources.",
      "translation": "替换与<code>Servlet</code>相关的属性源。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Replace any stub property sources with actual instances.",
      "translation": "将任何存根属性源替换为实际实例。",
